# Planning rules

- **Change** = one logical unit in `changes/<slug>/`
- Artifacts: `proposal.md`, `design.md`, `tasks.md`, `specs/` (deltas), `roles/`
- Spec deltas use ADDED / MODIFIED / REMOVED sections (OpenSpec style)
- Role agents write to `roles/*.md` — never write application code
- **PM office-hours artifact** (`roles/pm.md`): demand evidence + status quo + assignment must be substantive before architect/engineer/qa on build intent; problem before implementation
- **CEO** (`roles/ceo.md`): scope mode + must-haves before architect on full roundtable
- **Architect** (`roles/architect.md`): selected option + path coverage before engineer
- **QA** (`roles/qa.md`): EARS traced to PM wedge; checker artifact (`roles/checker.md`) on verify pass
- Human gates: after PM questions, after PM artifact gate, after architect option pick, before execute
- Update `.planning/STATE.md` decisions when scope or architecture is locked

## tasks.md

- One checkbox = one `/execute` session
- Include EARS acceptance criteria from QA role
- Mark `[x]` only when task is fully done and committed
